ackages/trialforge-core/tests/unit/test_models.py packages/trialforge-core/tests/regression/test_contracts.py -q`; `./scripts/lint.sh`; `python -m pytest`; `python scripts/check_imports.py`, and report the real pass/fail/skip counts.",
